    "created_at": "2016-01-31T01:13:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-31T01:13:32Z",
    "body": "Overloading `font` IDL attribute to accept `FontFace` would mean that you only set `font-family` to something, you can't set `font-size` and so on, unless I'm missing something.\n\nAFAICT it's already possible to use `FontFace`-loaded fonts by referring to them by name, and the spec says to use a fallback font if it's not loaded yet.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
