    "created_at": "2017-09-13T09:08:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-13T09:08:45Z",
    "body": "The issue as I see it is that when you use a font on a canvas the ligatures are either **on** or **off** depending on what the hosting browser does by default with that font. In regular use in the web page the ligatures can be made consistent across all browsers using the css properties for ligatures. You can't seem to do this on a canvas, which is a pain.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
