    "created_at": "2017-09-13T15:52:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-13T15:52:55Z",
    "body": "@tabatkins FontFaceSet is already spec'ed out for workers: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-font-loading-3/#fontfacesource-workers so adding them to worklets seems reasonable (i.e., make WorkletGlobalScope a FontFaceSource).\r\n\r\nRegarding @willia58 comment on ligatures, it seems that, for workers (and worklets) you could still support ligature as specified on the FontFace featureSettings, right? That means it's always consistent, within the context. Unless I misunderstood what you mean.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
